    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_headings_intro">Izikrini namakhasi ewebhu kuhlukanisa okuqukethwe kwakho ngezihloko. Isilawuli sokufunda esithi Izihloko seqa sisuka kwesinye isihloko siye kwesilandelayo.</string>
