    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_welcome_intro">Lokhu kokufundisa kufundisa ukunyakaza kwe-SandFly. Isifundo ngasinye sinikeza umyalelo, silinde uze uwenze ngokunyakaza kwakho, bese sinikeza olandelayo. Umyalelo uyinto yokuqala ngemva kwegama lesifundo. Okuthi Okuqukethwe kubala zonke izifundo, futhi okokufundisa kuvuleka futhi esifundweni obukuso.</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_welcome_start"><xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap">%1$s</xliff:g> noma kuphi esikrinini ukuze uqale.</string>
